  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Malawi VAWG Prevention and Response Programme</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Malawi Violence Against Women and Girls (VAWG) Prevention and Response Programme is funded by the UK Department for International Development (DFID) and delivered by Coffey in a consortium with Social Development Direct and Plan International. The first phase of implementation (until May 2022) and will see the programme test intervention pilots for potential scale-up in Phase 2 (June 2022-November 2024).</narrative>
  </description>
