  <activity-status code="5"></activity-status>
  <activity-date iso-date="2019-05-01" type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Programme&#x2019;s objective is to reduce the prevalence of violence against women and girls and improve the justice system for women and girls living with violence in Malawi. The Programme&#x2019;s objective is to reduce the prevalence of violence against women and girls and improve the justice system for women and girls living with violence in Malawi. It will do this by achieving the following Outcomes: &#x2022; Formal and informal justice services and local institutions are accessible, responsive and accountable to women and children&#x2019;s needs;</narrative>
  </activity-date>
